  "solution": {
    "text": "In Isoelectronic species, number of electrons should be same <br/>Number of electrons present in <math><msup><mrow><mtext>Li</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>+</mtext></mrow></msup><mtext>= 3</mtext><mo>-</mo><mtext>1 = 2</mtext></math>  <br/>Number of electrons present in <math><msup><mrow><mtext>Na</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>+</mtext></mrow></msup><mtext>= 11</mtext><mo>-</mo><mtext>1 = </mtext><mtext>10</mtext></math>  <br/>(A) <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math>  <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math>  <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math>  <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math>  <br/>(B) <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math>  <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math>  <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math>  <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math>  <br/>(C) <math><msup><mrow><mtext>F</mtext></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mtext>= 9+1 = 10</mtext></math>  <br/><math><msup><mrow><mtext>O</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mtext>= 8+2 = 10</mtext></math>  <br/><math><msup><mrow><mtext>N</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mtext>= 7+3 = 10</mtext></math>  <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math>  <br/>(d) <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math>  <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math>  <br/><math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math>  <br/><math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math>  <br/>Hence, <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> are isoelectronic."
  }
